    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardWelcomeTitle">Welcome</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardWelcomeHelp">This assistant prepares a simple starting configuration. You can fine-tune everything later in settings.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardWelcomeBody">Controller Manager tracks the controllers you use in a game session, warns you on disconnects, and can temporarily stop the game so you do not lose progress.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardPauseTitle">What should happen on disconnect?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardPauseHelp">Choose the default protection when a participating controller disconnects. Each game can still override this later.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardFeedbackTitle">How should you be notified?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardFeedbackHelp">Pick the overlay and toast notifications you want while playing or browsing Playnite.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardOverlayHelp">Shows a full-screen card when a session controller disconnects so you know what to do next.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardAccessTitle">Quick access</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardAccessHelp">Choose how Controller Manager and the Gamepad Tester appear in Playnite Desktop.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardSidebarHelp">Adds Gamepad Tester to the Desktop sidebar. Changing this later requires restarting Playnite.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardSummaryTitle">Review and save</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardSummaryHelp">Saving only updates Controller Manager settings. Open settings anytime to change colors, tester options, or per-game overrides.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardSummaryBody">Disconnect protection: {0}\nOverlay: {1}\nFullscreen notifications: {2}\nDesktop notifications: {3}\nTop panel: {4}\nTester sidebar: {5}\nPress Guide to open Fullscreen: {6}</sys:String>
